<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs-Monday actual 109,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs-Monday actual 109,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monday's actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts were 109,000 head, compared with the estimate of 110,000, according to USDA.</p>
<p>Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales of Barrows and Gilts $0.50 per cwt higher than midsession Monday.</p>
<p>					Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		  56.00 -57.00	   57.00 -58.00</p>
<p>few			    55.50 -57.50	   56.50 -58.50</p>
<p>Sows:  under 500 lbs steady to $2.00 higher, 500 up mostly steady to $2.00 lower.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs.     43.00 -46.00	   44.00 -46.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.		 46.00 -50.00	   47.00 -50.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up		  50.00 -56.00	   52.00 -58.00</p>
